# is attacked by every champion that can reach it, before the weakest-in-range fallback. Parent: tune-5 / tune-r-all-v2 + rall2-ca4-lean-g + zg14.
# rall2-ca4-lean-g: rall2-ca4-lean + fuel_remaining() > 60000 gate on the low-health retreat dash.
# rall2-ca4-lean [hybrid line]: rall2-ca4 with one enemies_visible() per turn (shared by the spawn-heal check, cast-ahead and the in-range fight) and nearest() only when an enemy is visible; tune-r-all-v2 + cast damage/stun at the nearest enemy champion within 4 tiles (no move).
# tune-r-all-v2 [line: tune]: tune5-campreset + map fixes (r800 monolith fallback, T240 threat bank, monolith-group
# goal exclusion) + safe recall R8-H0.3; fuel: monolith groups as a keep, threat-bank branch gated on fuel_remaining() > 65000.
# tune5-reset: tune-5 + attack reset cast after the first basic attack, then a second attack.
# tune-5 [line: tune]: parent tune-3. Camp-goal dash from distance > 2 (was 4) and Jungle shards = half the rest after
# Treasure (was a third).
# v7zg-cast: ability-type-aware casting (shield/heal on self, dash kept for escape and far camp goals).
# v7-zerogem: no fighting enemies on their own spawn, fight a camp that is the only way to an altar, go for monoliths
# when nothing is tributed by round 300.

# zg14: ability-type-aware casting: shield/heal on self, dash kept for escape/travel
